{"id":"bewusst","lemma":"bewusst","pos":"adj","rank":1410,"glosses":["conscious, aware","intentional"],"ipa":"/bəˈvʊst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/De-bewusst.ogg/De-bewusst.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"bewusster","superlative":"am bewusstesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin mir der Tatsache bewusst.","en":"I am aware of the fact.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755097","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"fact"},null]},{"text":"Er war sich der Gefahr bewusst.","en":"He was aware of the danger.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"danger"},null]},{"text":"Dein Problem ist mir bewusst.","en":"I'm aware of your problem.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Er ist sich seiner eigenen Fehler bewusst.","en":"He's aware of his own faults.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"own","l":"eigen"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind uns der Situation bewusst.","en":"We're aware of the situation.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"situation"},null]}]}